=== FILE index.html ===
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

<button>Click me!</button>
=== FILE style.css ===
button {
	font-size: 80px;
	cursor: pointer;
	transition: .2s;
}

button:hover {
	background-color: black;
	color: white;
}

button:active {
	transform: scale(0.5);
}
=== INFO ===
Make this button extremely UNsatisfying to click!
